      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 4.77,
          "en": "Now when sending HTTP requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.77,
          "end": 8.04,
          "en": "no matter if you are sending data or fetching data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.04,
          "end": 11.073,
          "en": "sometimes things can also go wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.06,
          "end": 15.84,
          "en": "And to show you a scenario where things do go wrong,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.84,
          "end": 18.15,
          "en": "I'll go back to the grocery list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.15,
          "end": 22.11,
          "en": "And there in load items that can simulate such an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.11,
          "end": 25.05,
          "en": "by using an invalid project ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.05,
          "end": 26.733,
          "en": "A, B, C, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.23,
          "end": 31.71,
          "en": "If I do that and I save and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.71,
          "end": 34.53,
          "en": "you will see that here we're stuck on the loading screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.53,
          "end": 36.12,
          "en": "Nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.12,
          "end": 37.53,
          "en": "And this happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.53,
          "end": 40.41,
          "en": "because if you take a look at the debug console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.41,
          "end": 42.45,
          "en": "in the end here, I got an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.45,
          "end": 45,
          "en": "Now the exact error message might be different.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45,
          "end": 47.73,
          "en": "It depends on the problem you're facing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.73,
          "end": 49.59,
          "en": "But the main problem here, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.59,
          "end": 52.59,
          "en": "is that we're not getting back the data from this backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.59,
          "end": 55.65,
          "en": "because here the URL is wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.65,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "Now, of course, that's an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 59.25,
          "en": "you typically can avoid as a developer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.25,
          "end": 63.09,
          "en": "You can simply test this app and use the correct URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.09,
          "end": 66.213,
          "en": "I'm just using this scenario here as a demo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.23,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "But of course you can definitely face some problems",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.08,
          "end": 71.46000000000001,
          "en": "when sending requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.46000000000001,
          "end": 74.22,
          "en": "because, for example, the Firebase servers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.22,
          "end": 78,
          "en": "could be offline temporarily or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78,
          "end": 80.94,
          "en": "Therefore, when sending HTTP requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.94,
          "end": 84.53999999999999,
          "en": "you must be prepared for things to go wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 87.57,
          "en": "And you can find out if something went wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.57,
          "end": 90.363,
          "en": "by taking a look at the response status code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.28999999999999,
          "end": 93,
          "en": "If I print this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93,
          "end": 96.47999999999999,
          "en": "and I reload so that this app restarts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.47999999999999,
          "end": 99.12,
          "en": "you can now see in the debug console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.12,
          "end": 102.9,
          "en": "that somewhere in here you will find this status code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.9,
          "end": 105.72,
          "en": "in my case here, 404",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.72,
          "end": 109.28999999999999,
          "en": "because it doesn't find a project with that ID here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.49000000000001,
          "en": "as it seems.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 114.45,
          "en": "Or it doesn't find a shopping list note there at least.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.45,
          "end": 116.03999999999999,
          "en": "And as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.03999999999999,
          "end": 120.69,
          "en": "if status code is greater than 400,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.69,
          "end": 123.865,
          "en": "you basically have a problem because all these 400",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.865,
          "end": 127.23,
          "en": "and 500 codes are error codes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.23,
          "end": 130.62,
          "en": "And here we might wanna check for our status code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.62,
          "end": 133.11,
          "en": "to be greater or equal than 400",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.11,
          "end": 135.78,
          "en": "to then show an error message to the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.78,
          "end": 138.9,
          "en": "instead of keeping them stuck on this loading screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.9,
          "end": 142.14,
          "en": "At least we don't wanna keep them there without telling them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 142.14,
          "end": 143.403,
          "en": "that something's wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.6,
          "end": 148.2,
          "en": "Now, you can either check for any error as I'm doing it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.2,
          "end": 151.92000000000002,
          "en": "or look for individual error codes like 404,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.92000000000002,
          "end": 154.65,
          "en": "which you get if a resource has not been found,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.65,
          "end": 157.2,
          "en": "to show error specific error messages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.2,
          "end": 158.28,
          "en": "That's up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.28,
          "end": 160.713,
          "en": "Here, I'll use the more general approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.64,
          "end": 162.473,
          "en": "But with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.473,
          "end": 167.07,
          "en": "we can now introduce a new state variable error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.07,
          "end": 168.72,
          "en": "which might be null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.72,
          "end": 171.993,
          "en": "and which should eventually be a string if it's not null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.13,
          "end": 175.14,
          "en": "So that's how we can define it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 175.14,
          "end": 176.88,
          "en": "Property which may be null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.88,
          "end": 179.313,
          "en": "but which if it's not null, should be a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 180.3,
          "end": 184.773,
          "en": "We can set error here if we do have an error status code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.7,
          "end": 187.99,
          "en": "In that case, we could set error to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 189,
          "end": 191.16,
          "en": "failed to fetch data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 191.16,
          "end": 194.28,
          "en": "Please try again later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 194.28,
          "end": 195.81,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 195.81,
          "end": 198.543,
          "en": "The exact error message of course is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.59,
          "end": 200.423,
          "en": "Now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.423,
          "end": 204.39,
          "en": "you can then go down to your build method again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.39,
          "end": 206.37,
          "en": "and there at the very end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.37,
          "end": 208.2,
          "en": "after all these other if checks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 208.2,
          "end": 209.57999999999998,
          "en": "I want to add another if check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 209.57999999999998,
          "end": 212.88,
          "en": "and check if error is not equal to null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 212.88,
          "end": 214.92000000000002,
          "en": "which you can check like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.92000000000002,
          "end": 218.31,
          "en": "And if that's the case, I know that I have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 218.31,
          "end": 221.28,
          "en": "And, in that case, I don't care about what I wanted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 221.28,
          "end": 223.17000000000002,
          "en": "to display as content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 223.17000000000002,
          "end": 224.4,
          "en": "If it was the fallback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 224.4,
          "end": 227.67000000000002,
          "en": "or the progress indicator, I don't care about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.67000000000002,
          "end": 231.75,
          "en": "Instead, I wanna render my error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.75,
          "end": 233.91,
          "en": "And for that, I'll copy this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 233.91,
          "end": 236.91,
          "en": "and set content equal to this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 236.91,
          "end": 238.44,
          "en": "But now the text here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 238.44,
          "end": 241.05,
          "en": "will be the error message stored in error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 241.05,
          "end": 244.05,
          "en": "and therefore this can't be constant anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 244.05,
          "end": 246.33,
          "en": "Here we should also add an exclamation mark",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 246.33,
          "end": 248.67,
          "en": "because we know that error won't be null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 248.67,
          "end": 251.17,
          "en": "because that's literally what we're checking here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 252.54,
          "end": 255.66,
          "en": "So with that, I'm setting my content of this screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 255.66,
          "end": 258.84,
          "en": "to this error message if we have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 258.84,
          "end": 260.82,
          "en": "Of course, now I just must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 260.82,
          "end": 263.79,
          "en": "that in load items where I'm setting error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 263.79,
          "end": 265.95,
          "en": "I also call set state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 265.95,
          "end": 268.74,
          "en": "because since I'm outputting the error in the UI,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 268.74,
          "end": 269.82,
          "en": "I also must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 269.82,
          "end": 273.18,
          "en": "that the UI is updated if an error occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 273.18,
          "end": 275.373,
          "en": "And we do that with set state, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 276.36,
          "end": 279.12,
          "en": "With that, if I save this and force a reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 279.12,
          "end": 282.51,
          "en": "now we get this error message here if things go wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 282.51,
          "end": 284.28,
          "en": "And that's arguably of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 284.28,
          "end": 288.33,
          "en": "a better user experience than what we had before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 288.33,
          "end": 291.39,
          "en": "With that, I just want to add a dot here at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 291.39,
          "end": 294.33299999999997,
          "en": "I'm happy with that and we definitely improved the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 295.35,
          "end": 296.7,
          "en": "Now with that adjustment made,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 296.7,
          "end": 298.86,
          "en": "I will of course grab the correct URL again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 298.86,
          "end": 300.18,
          "en": "and use that again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 300.18,
          "end": 302.52,
          "en": "because I don't wanna break this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 302.52,
          "end": 305.55,
          "en": "Without https and this slash here, by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 305.55,
          "end": 307.08,
          "en": "Because I don't wanna break this app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 307.08,
          "end": 309.84,
          "en": "I just wanted to show you how you could handle errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 309.84,
          "end": 311.52,
          "en": "Of course, the default case here is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 311.52,
